  "label": "Racial Stereotype: White People as Rowdy/Uninhibited",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that white people are inherently wild, uninhibited, or 'out of control' after consuming alcohol, which is a harmful racial trope. This stereotype is used to contrast with the portrayal of Black people as composed, reinforcing a racial hierarchy by implying inherent behavioral differences based on race.",
